1. **Enemy princess towers still read instant 0% on any damage** — confirmed the exact same root cause as the ally fix above: princess-*enemy*'s `EMPTY_BGR` (BGR~29,2,107) was ALSO measured from a border/bezel row, not a real empty-fill transition — directly confirmed by comparing it against a fresh 100%-health capture's own border row (BGR~29-34,2-4,114-118, nearly identical) that couldn't possibly be real "empty" color on a tower showing zero transition across its full width. **Not fixed yet** — needs a real capture of an enemy princess tower actually damaged (not just full-health) to measure the true transition point, same process as the ally fix. Asked Duncan for one.
