TV Royale pipeline status: **REVIVED, no longer paused.** `perception/frame_diff.py`,
`data/auto_labeler.py` and `data/tv_royale_watcher.py` are built and unit-tested and are
now the intended data source. Still needs `config/tv_royale_regions.py` (a live calibration
session) and the TV Royale menu-navigation taps. Note the earlier decision to keep side OUT
